{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fairy Tale Tower Defense is a 3D cartoon style tower defense game with many levels. At the beginning of each level, a small amount of resources are given, and more resources can be obtained by killing monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The health and movement speed of each monster in the game are different. When they have an energy shield, their health will increase</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pumpkin turrets deal higher damage to shields, while other turrets deal lower damage to shields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is an explosive magic in the game that can deal damage to a group of monsters, with damage to high health monsters being percentage damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 upgradable defense turrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 magic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill tree that can be used to upgrade turrets and magic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 types of monsters (8 ordinary monsters+8 ordinary monsters with shields)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616320/extras/output_animation.gif?t=1747857886\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616320?t=1747857886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616320?t=1747857886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616320/b7e5256055a5a5584d85a05a298964d6ecd8ac80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747857886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616320/b7e5256055a5a5584d85a05a298964d6ecd8ac80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747857886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"F